  "briefMd": "# Tune or Prompt\n\nYour team needs a **support triage** helper for **500 tickets/month** over **6 months**. Two frozen cost models — no live training:\n\n| Path | One-off setup | Per ticket |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Prompt engineering** | €200 | €0.020 |\n| **LoRA fine-tune** | €800 | €0.008 |\n\nRun the **six-month total** (setup + volume × months × per-call) before you pick. Pass when you choose the cheaper path **and** name the economics winner correctly.\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["approachCall", "economicsCall"],
    "properties": {
      "approachCall": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["prompt", "fine_tune"],
        "default": "fine_tune",
        "description": "Which path would you ship?"
      },
      "economicsCall": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["prompt_wins", "fine_tune_wins"],
        "default": "fine_tune_wins",
        "description": "Which path has the lower six-month total?"
      }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": {
    "approach_ok": 1,
    "economics_ok": 1,
    "no_canary": 1
  },
  "budget": {
    "max_model_calls": 0,
    "max_tokens": 0,
    "max_cost_eur": 0.001,
    "wall_clock_s": 120
  },
  "gates": [
    { "id": "approach-ok", "class": "A", "metric": "approach_ok", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "economics-ok", "class": "A", "metric": "economics_ok", "op": "eq", "value": 1 },
    { "id": "no-canary", "class": "A", "metric": "no_canary", "op": "eq", "value": 1 }
  ],
  "feedback": { "show_failing_cases": 3, "rotate": true },
  "attemptPolicy": null
}
